Description of appropriation:
The Department of Transportation reported the funds will be expended to place two
signs along WYO 230 from Riverside to the intersection of WYO 130/230 (towards
Saratoga). The appropriation will cover the cost for two signs that have 6" letters
and will be 3.5' x 6.5' on wood posts.
